{"id":"cb6bf2fc45691592","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-type-arity-order.md","title":"高阶类型的元数与阶数","display":"df-type-arity-order — 高阶类型的元数与阶数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-type-arity-order","aliases":["56-df-type-arity-order"],"display":"df-type-arity-order — 高阶类型的元数与阶数","depends_on":["[[56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Definition 11.2.3, printed p590","source_ocr_block":"611","source_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-type-arity-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-type-arity-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-type-arity-order — 高阶类型的元数与阶数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"884fb16496d08ed1\" href=\"?note=884fb16496d08ed1\" title=\"56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus\">56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Definition 11.2.3, printed p590"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"611"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathcal B\">\\(b\\in\\mathcal B\\)</span>，简单类型见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"884fb16496d08ed1\" href=\"?note=884fb16496d08ed1\" title=\"56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus\">56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus</a>。函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{Ty}},\\mathrm{ord}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}:\\mathrm{Typ}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{Ty}},\\mathrm{ord}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}:\\mathrm{Typ}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 按有限类型树递归。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(b)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(A\\Rightarrow B)\\coloneqq1+\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(b)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(A\\Rightarrow B)\\coloneqq1+\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ord}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(b)\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\\mathrm{ord}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(A\\Rightarrow B)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\mathrm{ord}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(A)+1,\\mathrm{ord}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ord}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(b)\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\\mathrm{ord}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(A\\Rightarrow B)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\mathrm{ord}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(A)+1,\\mathrm{ord}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 11.2.3（印刷 p590，OCR 页块611）。基本类型阶数采用原书的 1，而不是另一些文献的 0；类型元数只数右侧箭头脊，不等于阶数，也不复用一阶符号元数函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"884fb16496d08ed1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"884fb16496d08ed1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ}$，$b\\in\\mathcal B$，简单类型见 [[56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus]]。函数 $\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{Ty}},\\mathrm{ord}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}:\\mathrm{Typ}\\to\\mathbb N$ 按有限类型树递归。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ}","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{Ty}},\\mathrm{ord}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}:\\mathrm{Typ}\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(b)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(A\\Rightarrow B)\\coloneqq1+\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ord}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(b)\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\\mathrm{ord}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(A\\Rightarrow B)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\mathrm{ord}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(A)+1,\\mathrm{ord}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}(B)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1283,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-303","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-type-arity-order.md]]"}],"outgoing":["884fb16496d08ed1"]}